# Trace metals: solar abundances (Asplund+2009 number ratios to H),
# Case D = Fe enhanced x4 (Huang+2023 WASP-121b enriched model).
# Each value is the TOTAL element abundance n_X/n_H (all ionization
# stages summed); the ionization-equilibrium solver distributes it over
# the ion stages.
# EXHALE reads this at runtime (no recompile); remove the file to
# run metals-off.
C     2.69e-4
N     6.76e-5
O     4.90e-4
Mg    3.98e-5
Ca    2.19e-6
Na    1.74e-6
Fe    1.264e-4
pp_metals 1
